abstract: "A nationwide open-source telecommunications intelligence platform and data pipeline aggregating official Polish Office of Electronic Communications (UKE) radio permits, 5G Standalone and C-band deployments, microwave backhaul radiolines, and environmental electromagnetic field (SI2PEM) laboratory measurements."
